---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Research Vol.01｜AI Platform Evolution｜J 的世界 Research">

<section class="page-hero">

  <div class="page-hero-inner">

    <div class="kicker">RESEARCH · VOL.01 · 2026</div>

    <h1>AI Platform Evolution</h1>

    <p>
      從台積電 2026 China Technology Symposium 出發，
      追蹤下一代 AI Platform 如何由先進製程、
      先進封裝、光互連、材料與 AI Infrastructure
      共同演進。
    </p>

  </div>

</section>


<section class="section">

  <div class="section-head">

    <div>
      <div class="kicker">VOL.01 · RESEARCH EDITION</div>
      <h2>Research Contents</h2>
    </div>

    <p>P1–P8</p>

  </div>


  <div class="contents-list">

    <a class="content-row" href="/research/vol01-p1">
      <div class="content-number">P1</div>
      <div>
        <span class="tag">STORY</span>
        <h3>從一場技術論壇開始</h3>
        <p>
          建立研究事件背景，理解 AI Platform
          為何正在發生結構性變化。
        </p>
      </div>
      <span class="arrow">→</span>
    </a>


    <a class="content-row" href="/research/vol01-p2">
      <div class="content-number">P2</div>
      <div>
        <span class="tag">EVIDENCE</span>
        <h3>先把事實與推論分開</h3>
        <p>
          建立 Facts First 與 Evidence Framework。
        </p>
      </div>
      <span class="arrow">→</span>
    </a>


    <a class="content-row" href="/research/vol01-p3">
      <div class="content-number">P3</div>
      <div>
        <span class="tag">AI PLATFORM EVOLUTION</span>
        <h3>四個訊號如何共同打造下一代 AI 平台？</h3>
        <p>
          Compute Scaling、Advanced Packaging、
          Optical Interconnect、Materials & Infrastructure。
        </p>
      </div>
      <span class="arrow">→</span>
    </a>


    <a class="content-row" href="/research/vol01-p4">
      <div class="content-number">P4</div>
      <div>
        <span class="tag">TECHNOLOGY</span>
        <h3>從晶片走向系統</h3>
        <p>
          建立 AI Platform 六節點技術路徑。
        </p>
      </div>
      <span class="arrow">→</span>
    </a>


    <a class="content-row" href="/research/vol01-p5">
      <div class="content-number">P5</div>
      <div>
        <span class="tag">GLASS CORE</span>
        <h3>Glass Core：結果，而不是起點</h3>
        <p>
          從 Glass、TGV 到 Core Substrate
          與 Advanced Packaging。
        </p>
      </div>
      <span class="arrow">→</span>
    </a>


    <a class="content-row" href="/research/vol01-p6">
      <div class="content-number">P6</div>
      <div>
        <span class="tag">INVESTMENT MATRIX</span>
        <h3>技術節點，如何轉換成產業觀察？</h3>
        <p>
          Process、Packaging、Optical、Materials、
          Infrastructure 與 System。
        </p>
      </div>
      <span class="arrow">→</span>
    </a>


    <a class="content-row" href="/research/vol01-p7">
      <div class="content-number">P7</div>
      <div>
        <span class="tag">FUTURE WATCH</span>
        <h3>下一個真正值得驗證的訊號</h3>
        <p>
          從驗證、導入、量產到擴散建立追蹤框架。
        </p>
      </div>
      <span class="arrow">→</span>
    </a>


    <a class="content-row" href="/research/vol01-p8">
      <div class="content-number">P8</div>
      <div>
        <span class="tag">REFERENCE & METHODOLOGY</span>
        <h3>研究方法</h3>
        <p>
          Facts First、Evidence-Based Research、
          J Insight 與主要資料來源。
        </p>
      </div>
      <span class="arrow">→</span>
    </a>

  </div>

</section>


<section class="feature">

  <div class="section">

    <div class="section-head">

      <div>
        <div class="kicker">CONNECTED RESEARCH</div>
        <h2>從 Research 延伸出去</h2>
      </div>

    </div>


    <div class="grid">

      <article class="card">

        <span class="tag">INDUSTRY MAPS</span>

        <h3>AI / Glass Core / CPO</h3>

        <p>
          將 Research Vol.01 的技術節點
          放進完整產業鏈中觀察。
        </p>

        <a class="button-secondary" href="/maps">
          Explore Maps →
        </a>

      </article>


      <article class="card">

        <span class="tag">POSTERS</span>

        <h3>Visual Research</h3>

        <p>
          將研究濃縮成一頁式視覺化內容，
          快速掌握核心訊號。
        </p>

        <a class="button-secondary" href="/posters">
          Explore Posters →
        </a>

      </article>


      <article class="card">

        <span class="tag">FIRST PRINTING</span>

        <h3>Research Vol.01 PDF</h3>

        <p>
          開啟完整印刷級 First Printing，
          保存正式研究版本。
        </p>

        <a
          class="button-secondary"
          href="/downloads/J的世界_Research_Vol01_First_Printing.pdf"
          target="_blank"
        >
          Open PDF →
        </a>

      </article>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<section class="cta">

  <div class="cta-inner">

    <div>

      <div class="kicker">V1.2-04B</div>

      <h2>下一步：P1–P8 獨立閱讀。</h2>

      <p>
        每一頁將保留研究脈絡，
        並逐步加入來源、產業地圖、海報與相關研究連結。
      </p>

    </div>

    <a class="button" href="/research">
      Back to Research Library →
    </a>

  </div>

</section>


<style>

  .contents-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .content-row {
    border: 1px solid #2b394a;
    background: rgba(18, 27, 38, .82);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 22px 24px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 72px 1fr 30px;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: center;
    transition:
      border-color .2s ease,
      background .2s ease,
      transform .2s ease;
  }

  .content-row:hover {
    border-color: #52667d;
    background: rgba(25, 37, 51, .96);
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  .content-number {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #8299b1;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
  }

  .content-row h3 {
    margin: 6px 0 4px;
    font-size: 20px;
  }

  .content-row p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #9eabb9;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .arrow {
    font-size: 22px;
    color: #71869c;
  }

  .card .button-secondary {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  @media(max-width:800px) {

    .content-row {
      grid-template-columns: 52px 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 18px;
    }

    .content-number {
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .content-row h3 {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .content-row p {
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .arrow {
      display: none;
    }

  }

</style>

</BaseLayout>
